<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?><FinalDraft DocumentType="Script" Template="No" Version="3"><Content><Paragraph Number="1" Type="Scene Heading"><Text>FADE IN:</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Number="2" Type="Scene Heading"><Text>INT. STONEHILL INTERNATIONAL SCHOOL - DAY</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>A 16 year old boy is sitting on a sofa,that is right in front of principal's office.He has long hairs up to the neck and a thin diamond chain around his neck.He has silver earrings on one side of ear. He looks relaxed with a quiet smile on his face.We see a black fossil watch as he cracks his knuckles, there are light wounds of blood on knuckles.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>Another boy of same age is coming slowly through the corridor ,wearing a shining black leather jacket over his school shirt.We see there is a a fat, swollen cheek below his red blood eyes and a lip torn.He is ignoring other guy,sits on an armchair that is in front of the sofa, next to office door.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>The boy on the sofa leans backwards comfortably, wiping out blood from lips and then arms crossed.He smirks with jaw tight and anger radiating through his eyes.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>The other boy just ignores him and looks inside towards the office door. </Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Transition"><Text>CUT TO:</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Number="3" Type="Scene Heading"><Text>INT. PRINCIPAL OFFICE - DAY</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>Principal,almost 50,wearing a white shirt,is sitting on one side of table.His elbows on the table with fingers interlocked,he is in serious mood.To the right of principal,there is a woman(late thirties) with specs and a fair face.She has short hairs.She is holding a file.Her face looks faded and eyes dull.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>PRINCIPAL</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>Ok..now listen.I have a scheduled meeting so you have to handle it carefully.Pratyaksh's parents would might come in some minutes,...</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>OVER THE SHOULDERS-we look towards the Counselor's face.She seems lost in thinking something, Principal's voice was slowly getting dull in her head, another voice of a male was taking over with :</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>“We’re done. Stop pretending this can be patched up.”</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>&quot;I don’t miss you. Not even a little.”</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>All this voice suddenly break when principal asks her loud</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>PRINCIPAL(LOUD)</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>Do you understand!!</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>COUNSELOR</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>Yes i..i understand.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Transition"><Text>CUT TO:</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>The counselor leaves the office room and reaches to the boy sitting in armchair!</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>COUNSELOR</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>Pratyaksh..right?</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>Pratyaksh doesn't reply,he just nodes and looks away.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>COUNSELOR</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>Sit with him!you have to talk.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>He doesn't reply and sits there,completely ignoring her.He is looking nervous,his sneakers continuously taps on the floor,fingers interlocked,praying for something.He is thinking,we hear quiet voice of his mind.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>Mom,please come fast!</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>As a faint hum of a luxury car grows louder,he stands up quickly,raises his head and looking for something.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Transition"><Text>CUT TO:</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>We see the backside of car,A BLACK GLOSSY SEDAN,mother comes out first, she is in a rigid posture as she is walking in a courtroom, with eyes focused.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text> And then the father comes out,wearing a blue polished blazer on his bright white shirt,but he looks worried,in a hurry,rubbing his forehead with his fingers.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>As they both go inside the hall,counselor reaches to them and gives her introduction.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>COUNSELOR</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>Good afternoon sir and mam,my name is neha and i am the school counselor.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>Counselor calls pratyaksh and jatin,they both stood up and reaches to the counselor.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>FATHER(HEAVY VOICE)</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>What was happened!son...are you hurt badly!</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>MOTHER(COLD TONE)</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>God,look at you!Do you realize,what is your condition right now? I told you to stay out of trouble. You never listen.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>Pratyaksh freezes after listening this words from his mom,his shoulders slump,his lips part,like he might defend himself, but the words shrivel before they leave.His sadness was noticed by counselor.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>COUNSELOR</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>Pratyaksh..explain why was the fight? </Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>PRATYAKSH(FEARLESS)</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>He was mocking me about my father,i could not resist something about my family!</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>COUNSELOR(CALMLY)</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>You should reach out us first..both of you are guilty in this situation,if they were any other kids, they would be suspended by now.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Parenthetical"><Text>(pointing out to parents)</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>Mother freezes,her eyes narrow with anger,letting the silence for a second.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>MOTHER(SHARP TONE)</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>Careful!if it would be his fault,then also you should not say that!you should know whom you are blaming!</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>FATHER</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>It is not his fault either,jatin should not raise a sensitive topic,he should be suspended.look how pratyaksh is beaten!</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Parenthetical"><Text>(pointing to jatin)</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>Jatin gets frustrated by this,his jaw tightens and he defends himself.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>JATIN</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>So what did i say wrong!your company PRESTIGIOUS is falling,and it's your fault,the company's dark crime is now exposing,and the world knows it's condition,the takeover that is ruining your reputation.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>Pratyaksh looks into jatin's eyes with anger.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>PRATYAKSH(ANGRILY)</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>How to dare to talk like this to my father !He has built the empire that you can not imagine of.keep your mouth better shut!</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>Jatin smiles and looks into his father's eyes.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>JATIN</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>I am happy by looking the chaos in your family,...it's my payoff.Your family’s empire looks all shiny from the outside, but they are all corrupt.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>All were shocked by listening this.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>MOTHER(HESITATING)</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>What are you talking?what payoff.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>JATIN(MOCKING)</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>Don't pretend that you don't remember it ...remember ANANYA,she was my sister,your company cheated her.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>PRATYAKSH(CONFUSED)</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>What..what thing are you talking about,who is ananya?are you out of mind?</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>Jatin's voice start getting hard,but there was a pain in his voice.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>JATIN</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>No..you really don't get it now?my elder sister was their ex-employee,she was in management in your's father clothing industry..but company was secretly burning clothes to protect its luxury image..tons of shipments were burnt. And also,company was hiding numbers from it's shareholders.Fake profits,audits,billions covered up and what not!</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>She was trying to expose them,she had the proofs but what did they do..your mother bribed the judge,and then-they blacklisted her,ruining her carrier.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>It's payoff that father is buying your company.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>Pratyaksh was really shock after listening this,he looks towards his parents and feels ashamed. He leaves the room after saying.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>PRATYAKSH(CRYING)</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>Mom,dad-i believed in you,but every time,as always ..</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Parenthetical"><Text>(MORE)</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>PRATYAKSH (CONT'D)</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>i did not meet my expectations over you.There is always something,you hided.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>MOTHER(ANGRILY)</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>Behave pratyaksh,WE ARE YOUR PARENTS!</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>Pratyaksh leaves quickly out of the school without looking once towards his parents.Jatin also leaves as instructed by the counselor.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>MOTHER(TO COUNSELOR)</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>Listen,this should not be out !</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>COUNSELOR</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>Do you guys really care about your son!he is troubled and can't you even see that.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>FATHER</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>No..we love him..it's just we can't give him the time</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>COUNSELOR</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>That is what he is deprived of!</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>Counselor thinks about pratyaksh,in her mind and looks worried about him.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Transition"><Text>CUT TO:</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Number="4" Type="Scene Heading"><Text>INT.PARK-NIGHT</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>Pratyaksh is sitting with his father on a park bench.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>PRATYAKSH(ASKING,SAD)</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>Everything will become fine as before?</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>FATHER(ASSURING)</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>Believe me son,me and your mom will rebuild-just as it was before and this time,you will be with us.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>PRATYAKSH</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>Stop,dad.Mom doesn't care about me,my needs,she wants me to be perfect,she only care about my achievements and you, you are always busy in work.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>Father holds pratyaksh hands and looks into his eyes.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>FATHER</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>We know that we are not perfect,mom wants you to be perfect because she wants you to be successful,i am busy so that i can provide all luxuries to you,and remember the meaning of a relationship is not in being perfect for someone, it is in being present for them and we are present for you at any time.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>Pratyaksh nods and they both hug each other.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>We see beside that bench,counselor was standing and listening to their conversation,the line&quot;the meaning of a relationship is not in being perfect for someone, it is in being present for them&quot;echoes in her mind.Probably she is connecting it her life.She smiles,seeing the boy and father together.</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>FADE OUT</Text></Paragraph></Content><PageLayout BackgroundColor="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" BottomMargin="72" BreakDialogueAndActionAtSentences="Yes" DocumentLeading="Normal" FooterMargin="36" ForegroundColor="#000000000000" HeaderMargin="36" InvisiblesColor="#808080808080" TopMargin="72" UsesSmartQuotes="Yes"><PageSize Height="11.69" Width="8.26"/><AutoCastList AddParentheses="Yes" AutomaticallyGenerate="Yes" CastListElement="Cast List"/></PageLayout><TitlePage><Content><Paragraph Type="General" Alignment="Left" LeftIndent="1.25" RightIndent="7.25" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1.0" StartsNewPage="No"/><Paragraph Type="General" Alignment="Left" LeftIndent="1.25" RightIndent="7.25" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1.0" StartsNewPage="No"/><Paragraph Type="General" Alignment="Left" LeftIndent="1.25" RightIndent="7.25" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1.0" StartsNewPage="No"/><Paragraph Type="General" Alignment="Left" LeftIndent="1.25" RightIndent="7.25" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1.0" StartsNewPage="No"/><Paragraph Type="General" Alignment="Left" LeftIndent="1.25" RightIndent="7.25" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1.0" StartsNewPage="No"/><Paragraph Type="General" Alignment="Left" LeftIndent="1.25" RightIndent="7.25" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1.0" StartsNewPage="No"/><Paragraph Type="General" Alignment="Left" LeftIndent="1.25" RightIndent="7.25" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1.0" StartsNewPage="No"/><Paragraph Type="General" Alignment="Left" LeftIndent="1.25" RightIndent="7.25" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1.0" StartsNewPage="No"/><Paragraph Type="General" Alignment="Left" LeftIndent="1.25" RightIndent="7.25" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1.0" StartsNewPage="No"/><Paragraph Type="General" Alignment="Left" LeftIndent="1.25" RightIndent="7.25" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1.0" StartsNewPage="No"/><Paragraph Type="General" Alignment="Left" LeftIndent="1.25" RightIndent="7.25" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1.0" StartsNewPage="No"/><Paragraph Type="General" Alignment="Left" LeftIndent="1.25" RightIndent="7.25" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1.0" StartsNewPage="No"/><Paragraph Type="General" Alignment="Left" LeftIndent="1.25" RightIndent="7.25" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1.0" StartsNewPage="No"/><Paragraph Type="General" Alignment="Left" LeftIndent="1.25" RightIndent="7.25" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1.0" StartsNewPage="No"/><Paragraph Type="General" Alignment="Left" LeftIndent="1.25" RightIndent="7.25" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1.0" StartsNewPage="No"/><Paragraph Type="General" Alignment="Left" LeftIndent="1.25" RightIndent="7.25" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1.0" StartsNewPage="No"/><Paragraph Type="General" Alignment="Center" LeftIndent="1.25" RightIndent="7.25" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1.0" StartsNewPage="No"><Text Style="Underline">FMaC round 2</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="General" Alignment="Left" LeftIndent="1.25" RightIndent="7.25" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1.0" StartsNewPage="No"/><Paragraph Type="General" Alignment="Left" LeftIndent="1.25" RightIndent="7.25" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1.0" StartsNewPage="No"/><Paragraph Type="General" Alignment="Left" LeftIndent="1.25" RightIndent="7.25" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1.0" StartsNewPage="No"/><Paragraph Type="General" Alignment="Center" LeftIndent="1.25" RightIndent="7.25" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1.0" StartsNewPage="No"><Text>Written by</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="General" Alignment="Left" LeftIndent="1.25" RightIndent="7.25" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1.0" StartsNewPage="No"/><Paragraph Type="General" Alignment="Center" LeftIndent="1.25" RightIndent="7.25" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1.0" StartsNewPage="No"/><Paragraph Type="General" Alignment="Left" LeftIndent="1.25" RightIndent="7.25" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1.0" StartsNewPage="No"/><Paragraph Type="General" Alignment="Left" LeftIndent="1.25" RightIndent="7.25" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1.0" StartsNewPage="No"/><Paragraph Type="General" Alignment="Left" LeftIndent="1.25" RightIndent="7.25" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1.0" StartsNewPage="No"/><Paragraph Type="General" Alignment="Left" LeftIndent="1.25" RightIndent="7.25" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1.0" StartsNewPage="No"/><Paragraph Type="General" Alignment="Left" LeftIndent="1.25" RightIndent="7.25" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1.0" StartsNewPage="No"/><Paragraph Type="General" Alignment="Left" LeftIndent="1.25" RightIndent="7.25" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1.0" StartsNewPage="No"/><Paragraph Type="General" Alignment="Left" LeftIndent="1.25" RightIndent="7.25" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1.0" StartsNewPage="No"/><Paragraph Type="General" Alignment="Left" LeftIndent="1.25" RightIndent="7.25" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1.0" StartsNewPage="No"/><Paragraph Type="General" Alignment="Left" LeftIndent="1.25" RightIndent="7.25" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1.0" StartsNewPage="No"/><Paragraph Type="General" Alignment="Left" LeftIndent="1.25" RightIndent="7.25" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1.0" StartsNewPage="No"/><Paragraph Type="General" Alignment="Left" LeftIndent="1.25" RightIndent="7.25" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1.0" StartsNewPage="No"/><Paragraph Type="General" Alignment="Left" LeftIndent="1.25" RightIndent="7.25" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1.0" StartsNewPage="No"/><Paragraph Type="General" Alignment="Left" LeftIndent="1.25" RightIndent="7.25" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1.0" StartsNewPage="No"/><Paragraph Type="General" Alignment="Left" LeftIndent="1.25" RightIndent="7.25" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1.0" StartsNewPage="No"/><Paragraph Type="General" Alignment="Left" LeftIndent="1.25" RightIndent="7.25" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1.0" StartsNewPage="No"/><Paragraph Type="General" Alignment="Left" LeftIndent="1.25" RightIndent="7.25" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1.0" StartsNewPage="No"/><Paragraph Type="General" Alignment="Left" LeftIndent="1.25" RightIndent="7.25" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1.0" StartsNewPage="No"/><Paragraph Type="General" Alignment="Left" LeftIndent="1.25" RightIndent="7.25" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1.0" StartsNewPage="No"/><Paragraph Type="General" Alignment="Left" LeftIndent="1.25" RightIndent="7.25" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1.0" StartsNewPage="No"/><Paragraph Type="General" Alignment="Left" LeftIndent="1.25" RightIndent="7.25" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1.0" StartsNewPage="No"/><Paragraph Type="General" Alignment="Left" LeftIndent="1.25" RightIndent="7.25" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1.0" StartsNewPage="No"/><Paragraph Type="General" Alignment="Left" LeftIndent="1.25" RightIndent="7.25" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1.0" StartsNewPage="No"/><Paragraph Type="General" Alignment="Left" LeftIndent="1.25" RightIndent="7.25" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1.0" StartsNewPage="No"/></Content></TitlePage></FinalDraft>
